  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kiran Sharad Mittal vs State Of Maharashtra on 28 April, 2023 Author: Amit Borkar Bench: Amit Borkar 2023:Bhc-As:13056 20-wp14 Vrj In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Writ Petition No.1497 Of 2023 Kiran Sharad Mittal ... Petitioner V/s. The State of Maharashtra ... Coram : Amit Borkar, J. Dated : April 28, 2023 P.C.: 1.",
    "facts": "The petition arises out of order of issuance of process dated 19th August 2020 passed by the learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Raigad, Alibaug for offences under sections 26(1), 26(2)(i), 3(1) (ZZ)(ix) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 read with Regulation 2.4.4.1 of the Food Safety and Standards (Food Products Standards and Food Additives) Regulation, 2011 punishable under section 59(i) of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006. 2. On perusal of the cause title of complaint, it appears that the petitioner resides outside territorial jurisdiction of the Magistrate.",
